  "description": "Pure WF4 capability. Builds recipient/channel/subject/body intents from item + stakeholder list + event_type. Delivery is caller-owned.\n\nImplemented and smoke-tested matrix (use_cases):\n- completed event with multiple stakeholders\n- nothing_to_notify when stakeholders is empty\n- status_changed event intents\n- blocked event intents\n\nKnown limitations (intentional in 1.0.1):\n- reason_code invalid_event_type and invalid_input removed; event_type is a schema enum and host-required fields make those guest denial paths unreachable without schema weakening\n- No actual notification delivery",
